<title>NETHERLANDS: Hagemeyer details 1996 stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Hagemeyer details 1996 stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading company Hagemeyer NV said on Wednesday it had set its 1996 optional final stock dividend at one new share per 110 held.</p>
<p>In February, the company announced it would pay a 1996 cash dividend of 2.28 guilders, of which 0.75 had already been paid as an interim dividend. The final payment could be taken up in cash or an optional dividend in new shares.</p>
<p>Hagemeyer's shares closed at 161.00 guilders on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Wednesday, up 1.50 from their previous close.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 (fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
